<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ Commerce Commission to take Southpower to court.</title>
<headline>NZ Commerce Commission to take Southpower to court.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New Zealand Commerce Commission said on Wednesday it would file court proceedings against Southpower Ltd for alleged anti-competitive behaviour.</p>
</text>
